; The Chosen Avenger Defense's power generator. Its map actor is mislabelled "Chosen Sarcophagus"
; by Firaxis' own loc, and the game holds no noun for it outside the objective sentence
; ("Destroy the Mobile Power Generator").
ChosenADGeneratorName="Mobile Power Generator"
